  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>RWA printed metrics were roughly flat this week:</strong> Distributed Value near $14.35B (-1.1% 30D). Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/11/16/new-defi-yield-generation-targets-scam-like-bank-accounts-that-keep-all-the-interest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">New DeFi-yield generation targets \u2018scam-like\u2019 bank accounts that keep all the interest</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Tokenized U.S. Treasuries remain the institutional bridge into RWAs:</strong> adoption is strongest where products plug into cash management, collateral, and liquidity workflows. Related: <a href=\"https://thedefiant.io/converge/tradfi-and-fintech/ondo-launches-s-p-500-portfolio-token-with-loss-buffers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ondo Launches S&amp;P 500 Portfolio Token With Loss Buffers</a> (The Defiant).</li><li><strong>Institutional commitments are still a leading share signal:</strong> Bank and asset-manager distribution deals often shift platform and network leadership before headline RWA totals fully catch up. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/ecosystems/2026-11-17-solana-trump-memecoin-launch-tested-infrastructure-institutional-push-lily-liu-says-442132\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Solana\u2019s Trump memecoin launch tested infrastructure ahead of institutional push, Lily Liu says</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Clearer rules tend to unlock balance-sheet participation and collateral workflows even when aggregate on-chain totals reprice slowly. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/business/2026-11-17-tether-nomad-brazil-investment-442097\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Tether Capital invests $15 million in Nomad, eyes wider access to USDT and XAUT in Brazil</a> (The Block).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
